:: Deadwood BirdTower FirstFlight []
<<npc "Great Hawk">><<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>
<<bird_fly_reveal_wings>>
<<switch $speech_attitude>>
  <<case "bratty">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Of course. So that you don't shove <<childhe>> down after me." you say with a grin.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "当然。为了避免你把<<childhe>>像我一样直接推下去。"你调笑着说。
    <</language>>
  <<case "meek">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I'll go with <<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">>." You give the Great Hawk a quick hug.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "我会跟<<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">>一起去。"你快速地拥抱了一下巨鹰。
    <</language>>
  <<case "neutral">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I'll come with you." You smile. "I can't miss <<babyhawks>>' first flight."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "我跟你一起去。"你微笑，"可不能错过<<babyhawks>>的第一次飞翔。"
    <</language>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Together you spring from the perch, spread your wings and hover in the air, guiding <<childname>> to move towards you.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你们一起从栖木上跃起，张开翅膀悬停在空中，引导<<childname>>向你们的方向移动。
<</language>>
<br>
<<switch $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[0]].development.trait>>
  <<case "clumsy">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childHe>> seems a little hesitant, but under your constant calls, <<childhe>> finally spreads <<childhis>> wings and lunges into the air.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childHe>>似乎有些犹豫，但在你们不断的呼唤下，<<childhe>>最终还是张开翅膀扑向空中。
    <</language>>
  <<case "sympathy">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        At your calls, <<childhe>> also spreads <<childhis>> wings and leaps from the perch.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        在你们的呼唤下，<<childhe>>也张开翅膀跳下了栖木。
    <</language>>
  <<case "clever">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        At your calls, <<childhe>> also spreads <<childhis>> wings and leaps from the perch.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        在你们的呼唤下，<<childhe>>也张开翅膀跳下了栖木。
    <</language>>
  <<case "dominant">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childhe>> immediately beats <<childhis>> wings and dives straight for the bottom of the tower.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childhe>>立刻拍打翅膀，向着塔底一跃而下。
    <</language>>
<</switch>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Pulled down by gravity, the <<= $cmonster ? "little harpy" : "little hawk">> plummets towards the ground. <<childhe>> flaps <<childhis>> wings desperately, letting instinct and the wind lift <<childhim>>, and a few feathers scatter behind <<childhim>> in the frantic flurry.
    <br><br>
    You follow close beside <<childhe>>, showing <<childhim>> with your own flight how to master the flowing wind.
    <br>
    <<childname>> copies you, flattening <<childhis>> wings and opening <<childhis>> tail to adjust <<childhis>> balance; the wind streams between <<childhis>> feathers, carrying <<childhim>> ever higher.
    <br>
    <<childHe>> beats <<childhis>> wings and lets out an excited shriek, tracing a beautiful curve through the air.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    重力的拉扯之下，<<= $cmonster ? "小哈比" : "小鹰">>急速地向地面坠去。<<childhe>>奋力地扇动翅膀，让本能和风托举起自己，一些羽毛在混乱的扑腾中飘散在<<childhe>>的身后。
    <br><br>
    你们跟随在<<childhe>>的身边，用自己飞行的姿态示意<<childhe>>如何驾驭流风。
    <br>
    <<childname>>模仿着展平翅膀，打开尾翼调整平衡，风从<<childhis>>的羽毛间穿过，让<<childhe>>不断攀升。
    <br>
    <<childHe>>拍打翅膀，发出兴奋的尖鸣声，在空中划出一道漂亮的曲线。
<</language>>
<<trauma -12>><<lltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 4>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Not to be outdone, <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>, <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>> and <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[3]>> swoop down after you with loud cries, joining your flying formation.
      Their flight paths are far too close; their wings smack against one another and they all lose their balance at once. <<your_bird_text "cap">> and you immediately dive towards the children, catching the young hawks before they hit the ground and helping them rise again.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      不甘示弱，<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>、<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>和<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[3]>>也高鸣着飞扑落下，加入你们的飞行队伍。
      他们的飞行轨迹太过接近，翅膀互相拍打在了一起，齐齐失去了平衡。<<your_bird_text "cap">>和你连忙俯冲赶向孩子们，在落地前将小鹰接住，帮助他们重新抬升。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<<elseif $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 3>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Not to be outdone, <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>> and <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>> swoop down after you with loud cries, joining your flying formation.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      不甘示弱，<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>和<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>也高鸣着飞扑落下，加入你们的飞行队伍。
  <</language>>
  <<if $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[1]].development.trait is $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[2]].development.trait>>
    <<switch $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[1]].development.trait>>
      <<case "clumsy" "dominant">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Their flight paths are far too close; their wings smack against one another and they both lose their balance. <<your_bird_text "cap">> and you immediately dive towards the children, catching the two young hawks before they hit the ground and helping them rise again.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            他们的飞行轨迹太过接近，翅膀互相拍打在了一起，双双失去了平衡。<<your_bird_text "cap">>和你连忙俯冲赶向孩子们，在落地前将两只小鹰接住，帮助他们重新抬升。
        <</language>>
      <<case "sympathy" "clever">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            The children copy your movements, awkwardly adjusting their course in the air, and come to your side guided by the wind.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            孩子们模仿着你们的动作，青涩地在空中调整方向，在风的引导下来到你们的身边。
        <</language>>
    <</switch>>
  <<else>>
    <<switch $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[1]].development.trait>>
      <<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>
      <<case "clumsy">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>> flaps <<childhis>> wings wildly, and finally finds <<childhis>> balance just before hitting the ground, catching the wind and gliding smoothly forward.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>胡乱地拍动翅膀，终于在即将触地前找到平衡，张开翅膀抓住风，平稳地向前滑行。
        <</language>>
      <<case "dominant">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>'s movements are even more graceful than <<childsiblings $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>'s, beating <<childhis>> wings unhurriedly and letting the wind guide <<childhim>> completely.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>的动作甚至比<<childsiblings $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>更加优美，不急不缓地拍动翅膀，把身体完全交给风的引导。
        <</language>>
      <<default>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>> awkwardly adjusts <<childhis>> course in the air and comes to your side guided by the wind.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>青涩地在空中调整方向，在风的引导下来到你们的身边。
        <</language>>
    <</switch>>
    <<switch $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[2]].development.trait>>
      <<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>
      <<case "clumsy">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Meanwhile, <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>> flaps <<childhis>> wings wildly, and finally finds <<childhis>> balance just before hitting the ground, catching the wind and gliding smoothly forward.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            另一边，<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>胡乱地拍动翅膀，终于在即将触地前找到平衡，张开翅膀抓住风，平稳地向前滑行。
        <</language>>
      <<case "dominant">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Meanwhile, <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>'s movements are even more graceful than <<childsiblings $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>'s, beating <<childhis>> wings unhurriedly and letting the wind guide <<childhim>> completely.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            另一边，<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>的动作甚至比<<childsiblings $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>更加优美，不急不缓地拍动翅膀，把身体完全交给风的引导。
        <</language>>
      <<default>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>> follows close behind <<childhis $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>紧随在<<childhis $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>身后。
        <</language>>
    <</switch>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
<<elseif $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 2>>
  <<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Not to be outdone, <<childname>> swoops down after you with a loud cry, joining your flying formation.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      不甘示弱，<<childname>>也高鸣着飞扑落下，加入你们的飞行队伍。
  <</language>>
  <<switch $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[1]].development.trait>>
    <<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>
    <<case "clumsy">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childHe>> flaps <<childhis>> wings wildly, and finally finds <<childhis>> balance just before hitting the ground, catching the wind and gliding smoothly forward.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childHe>>胡乱地拍动翅膀，终于在即将触地前找到平衡，张开翅膀抓住风，平稳地向前滑行。
      <</language>>
    <<case "dominant">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childHe>>'s movements are even more graceful than <<childsiblings $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>'s, beating <<childhis>> wings unhurriedly and letting the wind guide <<childhim>> completely.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childHe>>的动作甚至比<<childsiblings $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>更加优美，不急不缓地拍动翅膀，把身体完全交给风的引导。
      <</language>>
    <<default>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childHe>> awkwardly adjusts <<childhis>> course in the air and comes to your side guided by the wind.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childHe>>青涩地在空中调整方向，在风的引导下来到你们的身边。
      <</language>>
  <</switch>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The Great Hawk circles your children. <<bHe>> sends a proud shriek into the sky. "Our children will rule the sky."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      巨鹰绕着你们的孩子转圈。<<bHe>>向天空发出一声骄傲的尖鸣，"我们的孩子会是天空的主宰。"
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The Great Hawk circles your children. <<bHe>> sends a proud shriek into the sky, showing the world the triumph of <<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 5>>the newly fledged hawks<<else>><<childrenNames $BirdTower.scene.ids>><</if>>.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      巨鹰绕着你们的孩子转圈。<<bHe>>向天空发出一声骄傲的尖鸣，向世界炫耀<<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 5>>新生小鹰们<<else>><<childrenNames $BirdTower.scene.ids>><</if>>的胜利。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You can no longer hold back your own shriek of joy; the voices of you, your mate and your children carry across the whole moor. Your chorus sends the surrounding animals fleeing in fear, announcing that this land is about to gain new hunters.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你也难以按捺地发出喜悦的尖啸，你、你的配偶和你的孩子的声音传遍整个荒原，你们的合奏让周围的动物害怕得四散逃逸，宣告着这片土地即将迎来新的猎手。
<</language>>
<<trauma -12>><<lltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<earnFeat "Our First Flight">>
<<lanLink ['Fly', '飞'] 'Deadwood BirdTower FirstFlight Back'>>
  <<bird_pass 10>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower FirstFlight Back []
<<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You wheel and dive through the sky, teaching <<babyhawks>> with your bodies how to adapt to the heavens.
    As young as <<babyhawksthem>> still are, instinct wins out, and <<babyhawksthem>> soar freely through the sky on their own wings.
    <br><br>
    Before long <<babyhawksthem>> run out of energy, and with you accompanying them, they settle down onto the ground.
    You gather up <<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 5>>the newly fledged hawks<<else>><<childrenNames $BirdTower.scene.ids>><</if>> and slowly fly back to the tower.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你们在天空中上下翻飞，用身体教导<<babyhawks>>如何适应天空。
    尽管<<babyhawksthem>>还如此年幼，但本能占据了上风，带领着<<babyhawksthem>>用自己的翅膀在天空中尽情翱翔。
    <br><br>
    没一会儿，<<babyhawksthem>>就耗尽了精力，在你们的陪同下落在了地面上。
    你们抱起<<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 5>>新生小鹰们<<else>><<childrenNames $BirdTower.scene.ids>><</if>>，缓缓地飞回了高塔。
<</language>>
<<tiredness 60>><<gggtiredness>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    As soon as they are put back in the nest, <<babyhawks>> fall asleep. <<babyhawksthem>>'s little chests rise and fall quietly; clearly they are exhausted.
    You smile and gently brush <<babyhawks>>' wings, smoothing down the feathers ruffled out of place by the flight. <<your_bird_text "cap">> is doing the same thing.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    一被放回巢里，<<babyhawks>>就进入了梦乡。<<babyhawksthem>>小小的胸脯安静地起伏着，明显是精疲力竭了。
    你露出了一个微笑，轻轻拂过<<babyhawks>>的翅膀，理平因为飞行而杂乱翘起的羽毛。<<your_bird_text "cap">>也在做同样的事。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood BirdTower FirstFlight End'>>
  <<bird_pass 10>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower FirstFlight End []
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Once <<babyhawks>> are settled, the harpy turns to you and pulls you into a hug. "I'm so happy. Without <<wife>>, I could never have seen all this. You are the best mate."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      安抚好<<babyhawks>>，哈比转向你，将你拉入一个拥抱，"我太开心了。没有<<wife>>，不可能看到这一切。你是最好的伴侣。"
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 2>><<glove>>
  <br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe>> pecks you lightly on the face and leads you to sit together on the perch.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe>>在你脸上轻啄，带着你一起在栖木上坐下。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Once <<babyhawks>> are settled, the Great Hawk turns to you and nuzzles you affectionately for a while, a constant rumbling coo in <<bhis>> throat.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      安抚好<<babyhawks>>，巨鹰转向你，充满爱意地磨蹭了你一会儿，嘴里不断发出叽叽咕咕的颤鸣。
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 2>><<glove>>
  <br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe>> wraps you in <<bhis>> great wings and guides you to sit together on the perch.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe>>用巨大的翅膀抱住你，领着你一起在栖木上坐下。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<if !$BirdTower.seen.subadult>>
  <<set $BirdTower.seen.subadult to true>>
  <<if $monster is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Your <<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">> gazes into the distance, seeming full of all sorts of emotions. You stroke <<bHe>>'s soft feathers and quietly wait for <<bhe>> to settle.
        <br>
        The harpy rouses and holds you a little tighter. "The Great Hawk remembers long ago, the days with family. The feeling of the first flight." <<bHe>> sinks into the memory. "Long, long ago. The Great Hawk was once very lonely, but never again."
        <br><br>
        You sit together and enjoy a while of quiet time.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你的<<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">>望向远方，似乎充满了各种各样的情绪。你抚摸着<<bHe>>毛茸茸的羽毛，静静地等待<<bhe>>平复心情。
        <br>
        哈比回过神来，将你抱得更紧了一些。"巨鹰想起了很久以前，和家人一起的日子。第一次飞行的感觉。"<<bHe>>沉浸在回忆里，"很久，很久以前。巨鹰曾经很孤独，但现在再也不会了。"
        <br><br>
        你们坐在一起，享受了一会儿平静的时光。
    <</language>>
    <<tiredness -6>><<ltiredness>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Your <<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">> gazes into the distance, seeming full of all sorts of emotions. You stroke <<bHe>>'s soft feathers and quietly wait for <<bhe>> to settle.
        <br>
        The Great Hawk rouses and gently preens your hair with <<bhis>> beak. <<bHe>> seems nostalgic, grooming you with the tender care one gives a child; <<bhe>> seems lost in memory.
        <br><br>
        You sit together and enjoy a while of quiet time.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你的<<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">>望向远方，似乎充满了各种各样的情绪。你抚摸着<<bHe>>毛茸茸的羽毛，静静地等待<<bhe>>平复心情。
        <br>
        巨鹰回过神来，用喙轻轻梳理你的毛发。<<bHe>>的表现显得有些怀旧，用对待孩子一般的轻柔动作抚弄你，<<bhe>>似乎沉浸在回忆里。
        <br><br>
        你们坐在一起，享受了一会儿平静的时光。
    <</language>>
    <<tiredness -6>><<ltiredness>>
  <</if>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<BabyHawkStoryClean>><<bird_perch_options>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower FirstFlight Stay []
<<npc "Great Hawk">><<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>
<<switch $speech_attitude>>
  <<case "bratty">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "You two go ahead. Just don't shove <<childhe>> down after me." you say with a grin.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "你们去吧。可别把<<childhe>>像我一样直接推下去。"你调笑着说。
    <</language>>
  <<case "meek">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I'll wait here for <<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">> and <<babyhawks>>." You give the Great Hawk a quick hug.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "我会在这里等着<<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">>和<<babyhawks>>。"你快速地拥抱了一下巨鹰。
    <</language>>
  <<case "neutral">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "You two go; I'll watch from here." You smile. "I can't miss <<babyhawks>>' first flight."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "你们去吧，我会在这儿看着。"你微笑，"可不能错过<<babyhawks>>的第一次飞翔。"
    <</language>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<your_bird_text "cap">> shrieks and springs from the perch, spreading <<bhis>> wings to hover in the air, guiding <<childname>> to move in <<bhis>> direction.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<your_bird_text "cap">>尖啸一声从栖木上跃起，张开翅膀悬停在空中，引导<<childname>>向<<bhis>>的方向移动。
<</language>>
<br>
<<switch $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[0]].development.trait>>
  <<case "clumsy">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childHe>> seems a little hesitant, but under the Great Hawk's constant calls, <<childhe>> finally spreads <<childhis>> wings and lunges into the air.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childHe>>似乎有些犹豫，但在巨鹰不断的呼唤下，<<childhe>>最终还是张开翅膀扑向空中。
    <</language>>
  <<case "sympathy">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        At the Great Hawk's calls, <<childhe>> also spreads <<childhis>> wings and leaps from the perch.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        在巨鹰的呼唤下，<<childhe>>也张开翅膀跳下了栖木。
    <</language>>
  <<case "clever">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        At the Great Hawk's calls, <<childhe>> also spreads <<childhis>> wings and leaps from the perch.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        在巨鹰的呼唤下，<<childhe>>也张开翅膀跳下了栖木。
    <</language>>
  <<case "dominant">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childhe>> immediately beats <<childhis>> wings and dives straight for the bottom of the tower.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childhe>>立刻拍打翅膀，向着塔底一跃而下。
    <</language>>
<</switch>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Pulled down by gravity, the <<= $cmonster ? "little harpy" : "little hawk">> plummets towards the ground. <<childhe>> flaps <<childhis>> wings desperately, letting instinct and the wind lift <<childhim>>, and a few feathers scatter behind <<childhim>> in the frantic flurry.
    <br><br>
    You look down from the top of the tower; the Great Hawk is following beside <<childhe>>, showing <<childhim>> with <<bhis>> own flight how to master the flowing wind.
    <br>
    <<childname>> copies <<bhim>>, flattening <<childhis>> wings and opening <<childhis>> tail to adjust <<childhis>> balance; the wind streams between <<childhis>> feathers, carrying <<childhim>> ever higher, until <<childhe>> returns to the height of the tower top.
    <br>
    <<childHe>> beats <<childhis>> wings and sweeps past your eyes with an excited shriek, tracing a beautiful curve through the air.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    重力的拉扯之下，<<= $cmonster ? "小哈比" : "小鹰">>急速地向地面坠去。<<childhe>>奋力地扇动翅膀，让本能和风托举起自己，一些羽毛在混乱的扑腾中飘散在<<childhe>>的身后。
    <br><br>
    你从塔顶向下望去，巨鹰正跟随在<<childhe>>的身边，用自己飞行的姿态示意<<childhe>>如何驾驭流风。
    <br>
    <<childname>>模仿着展平翅膀，打开尾翼调整平衡，风从<<childhis>>的羽毛间穿过，让<<childhe>>不断攀升，直到回到塔顶的高度。
    <br>
    <<childHe>>拍打着翅膀从你眼前掠过，伴随着兴奋的尖鸣声，在空中划出一道漂亮的曲线。
<</language>>
<<trauma -12>><<lltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 4>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Not to be outdone, <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>, <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>> and <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[3]>> swoop down from beside you with loud cries, joining this flying formation.
      Their flight paths are far too close; their wings smack against one another and they all lose their balance at once.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      不甘示弱，<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>、<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>和<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[3]>>也从你身边高鸣着飞扑落下，加入这支飞行队伍。
      他们的飞行轨迹太过接近，翅膀互相拍打在了一起，齐齐失去了平衡。
  <</language>>
  <<stress 3>><<gstress>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<your_bird_text "cap">> immediately dives towards the children, catching the young hawks before they hit the ground and helping them rise again.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<your_bird_text "cap">>连忙俯冲赶向孩子们，在落地前将小鹰接住，帮助他们重新抬升。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<<elseif $BirdTower.scene.ids.length is 3>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Not to be outdone, <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>> and <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>> swoop down from beside you with loud cries, joining this flying formation.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      不甘示弱，<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>和<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>也从你身边高鸣着飞扑落下，加入这支飞行队伍。
  <</language>>
  <<if $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[1]].development.trait is $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[2]].development.trait>>
    <<switch $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[1]].development.trait>>
      <<case "clumsy" "dominant">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Their flight paths are far too close; their wings smack against one another and they both lose their balance.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            他们的飞行轨迹太过接近，翅膀互相拍打在了一起，双双失去了平衡。
        <</language>>
        <<stress 3>><<gstress>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<your_bird_text "cap">> immediately dives towards the children, catching the two young hawks before they hit the ground and helping them rise again.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<your_bird_text "cap">>连忙俯冲赶向孩子们，在落地前将两只小鹰接住，帮助他们重新抬升。
        <</language>>
      <<case "sympathy" "clever">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            The children copy the Great Hawk's movements, awkwardly adjusting their course in the air, and fly to your <<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">> guided by the wind.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            孩子们模仿着巨鹰的动作，青涩地在空中调整方向，在风的引导下飞向你的<<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">>。
        <</language>>
    <</switch>>
  <<else>>
    <<switch $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[1]].development.trait>>
      <<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>
      <<case "clumsy">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>> flaps <<childhis>> wings wildly, and finally finds <<childhis>> balance just before hitting the ground, catching the wind and gliding smoothly forward.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>胡乱地拍动翅膀，终于在即将触地前找到平衡，张开翅膀抓住风，平稳地向前滑行。
        <</language>>
      <<case "dominant">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>'s movements are even more graceful than <<childsiblings $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>'s, beating <<childhis>> wings unhurriedly and letting the wind guide <<childhim>> completely.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>的动作甚至比<<childsiblings $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>更加优美，不急不缓地拍动翅膀，把身体完全交给风的引导。
        <</language>>
      <<default>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>> awkwardly adjusts <<childhis>> course in the air and flies to your <<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">> guided by the wind.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>青涩地在空中调整方向，在风的引导下飞向你的<<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">>。
        <</language>>
    <</switch>>
    <<switch $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[2]].development.trait>>
      <<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>
      <<case "clumsy">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Meanwhile, <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>> flaps <<childhis>> wings wildly, and finally finds <<childhis>> balance just before hitting the ground, catching the wind and gliding smoothly forward.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            另一边，<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>胡乱地拍动翅膀，终于在即将触地前找到平衡，张开翅膀抓住风，平稳地向前滑行。
        <</language>>
      <<case "dominant">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Meanwhile, <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>'s movements are even more graceful than <<childsiblings $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>'s, beating <<childhis>> wings unhurriedly and letting the wind guide <<childhim>> completely.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            另一边，<<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>的动作甚至比<<childsiblings $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>更加优美，不急不缓地拍动翅膀，把身体完全交给风的引导。
        <</language>>
      <<default>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>> follows close behind <<childhis $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<childname $BirdTower.scene.actors[2]>>紧随在<<childhis $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>身后。
        <</language>>
    <</switch>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
<<elseif $BirdTower.scene.ids.length is 2>>
  <<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Not to be outdone, <<childname>> swoops down from beside you with a loud cry, joining this flying formation.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      不甘示弱，<<childname>>也从你身边高鸣着飞扑落下，加入这支飞行队伍。
  <</language>>
  <<switch $childRecords[$BirdTower.scene.actors[1]].development.trait>>
    <<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[1]>>
    <<case "clumsy">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childHe>> flaps <<childhis>> wings wildly, and finally finds <<childhis>> balance just before hitting the ground, catching the wind and gliding smoothly forward.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childHe>>胡乱地拍动翅膀，终于在即将触地前找到平衡，张开翅膀抓住风，平稳地向前滑行。
      <</language>>
    <<case "dominant">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childHe>>'s movements are even more graceful than <<childsiblings $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>'s, beating <<childhis>> wings unhurriedly and letting the wind guide <<childhim>> completely.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childHe>>的动作甚至比<<childsiblings $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>更加优美，不急不缓地拍动翅膀，把身体完全交给风的引导。
      <</language>>
    <<default>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childHe>> awkwardly adjusts <<childhis>> course in the air and flies to your <<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">> guided by the wind.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childHe>>青涩地在空中调整方向，在风的引导下飞向你的<<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">>。
      <</language>>
  <</switch>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<childSelect $BirdTower.scene.actors[0]>>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The Great Hawk circles your children. <<bHe>> sends a proud shriek into the sky. "Our children will rule the sky."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      巨鹰绕着你们的孩子转圈。<<bHe>>向天空发出一声骄傲的尖鸣，"我们的孩子会是天空的主宰。"
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The Great Hawk circles your children. <<bHe>> sends a proud shriek into the sky, showing the world the triumph of <<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 5>>the newly fledged hawks<<else>><<childrenNames $BirdTower.scene.ids>><</if>>.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      巨鹰绕着你们的孩子转圈。<<bHe>>向天空发出一声骄傲的尖鸣，向世界炫耀<<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 5>>新生小鹰们<<else>><<childrenNames $BirdTower.scene.ids>><</if>>的胜利。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<if $harpy gte 6>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You can no longer hold back your own shriek of joy; the voices of you, your mate and your children carry across the whole moor. Your chorus sends the surrounding animals fleeing in fear, announcing that this land is about to gain new hunters.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你也难以按捺地发出喜悦的尖啸，你、你的配偶和你的孩子的声音传遍整个荒原，你们的合奏让周围的动物害怕得四散逃逸，宣告着这片土地即将迎来新的猎手。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You can no longer hold back the joy in your heart, and you cheer loudly for your children. The voices of your mate and your children carry across the whole moor; their chorus sends the surrounding animals fleeing in fear, announcing that this land is about to gain new hunters.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你也难以按捺心中的喜悦，为你的孩子高声欢呼。你的配偶和你的孩子的声音传遍整个荒原，他们的合奏让周围的动物害怕得四散逃逸，宣告着这片土地即将迎来新的猎手。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<trauma -12>><<lltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<beasttype>> wheels and dives through the sky, teaching <<babyhawks>> with <<bhis>> body how to adapt to the heavens. They fly further and further, shrinking in your sight into blurry silhouettes.
    <br>
    Before long <<babyhawksthem>> run out of energy, and with <<beasttype>> accompanying them, they settle down onto the ground.
    <br>
    <<bHe>> <<= $monster is 1? "picks up" : "grabs">> <<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 5>>the newly fledged hawks<<else>><<childrenNames $BirdTower.scene.ids>><</if>> and slowly flies back to the tower.
    <br>
    You take <<babyhawks>> <<= $monster is 1 ? "from <<beasttype>>'s arms" : "from <<beasttype>>'s talons">>; <<babyhawksthem>> are so tired they can barely open their eyes, and can only give tiny chirps in your arms.
    <br><br>
    As soon as they are put back in the nest, <<babyhawks>> fall asleep. <<babyhawksthem>>'s little chests rise and fall quietly; clearly they are exhausted.
    You smile and gently brush <<babyhawks>>' wings, smoothing down the feathers ruffled out of place by the flight. <<your_bird_text "cap">> is doing the same thing.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<beasttype>>在天空中上下翻飞，用身体教导<<babyhawks>>如何适应天空。他们越飞越远，在你的视野里缩小成一个个模糊的轮廓。
    <br>
    没一会儿，<<babyhawksthem>>就耗尽了精力，在<<beasttype>>的陪同下落在了地面上。
    <br>
    <<bHe>><<= $monster is 1? "抱起" : "抓起">><<if $BirdTower.scene.ids.length gte 5>>新生小鹰们<<else>><<childrenNames $BirdTower.scene.ids>><</if>>，缓缓地飞回了高塔。
    <br>
    你接过<<beasttype>><<= $monster is 1? "怀中" : "爪中">>的<<babyhawks>>，<<babyhawksthem>>已经累得睁不开眼，只能在你的怀里发出小小的轻鸣。
    <br><br>
    一被放回巢里，<<babyhawks>>就进入了梦乡。<<babyhawksthem>>小小的胸脯安静地起伏着，明显是精疲力竭了。
    你露出了一个微笑，轻轻拂过<<babyhawks>>的翅膀，理平因为飞行而杂乱翘起的羽毛。<<your_bird_text "cap">>也在做同样的事。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<earnFeat "Our First Flight">>
<<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood BirdTower FirstFlight End'>><</lanLink>>
<br>
